effect_entries = "Forces the target to have no Evade, and allows it to be hit by Normal and Fighting moves even if it's a Ghost. Resets the target's evasion to normal and prevents any further boosting until the target leaves the field.  A ghost under this effect takes normal damage from normal and fighting moves.  This move itself ignores accuracy and evasion modifiers."
